# Force LF regardless of the checkout platform. Windows checkouts default to
# CRLF (core.autocrlf=true), which makes Prettier flag every file as
# non-conforming even though the committed blobs are already LF — git
# converts back to LF on commit either way, so this just keeps local
# checkouts consistent with what `npm run format:check` / CI expect.
* text=auto eol=lf
